-	 * although mul_u64_u64_div_u64 returns a u64, in practice it
-	 * won't overflow due to above constraints. Take the max period
-	 * of 10^9 (NSEC_PER_SEC) and the pwm_div + 1 (IPQ_PWM_MAX_DIV)
-	 *  10^9 * 10^8
